-CA-21]","party":"D","state":"CA"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-03-14","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Expanding Medical Education Act</strong></p><p>This bill authorizes the Department of Health and Human Services (HHS) to award grants to institutions of higher education, or consortia of such institutions, to establish or expand medical schools.</p><p>In awarding these grants, HHS must prioritize minority-serving institutions or those that propose to establish or expand schools in medically underserved communities or areas with shortages of health professionals where no such schools exist.</p>","updateDate":"2026-10-14T16:26:25Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Expanding Medical Education Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-10-14T16:26:44Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-10-14T16:26:44Z"}
